 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "violet",
   "title": "Systems (ADR 0001)",
   "items": [
    "Each system declares Name, Phase, Reads, Writes, After/Before, Every/Offset/Stagger, RunIf",
    "Order: Kahn over (phase rank, name), built once; the resolved order is a golden file",
    "A conflict with no order between two systems fails the build unless AmbiguousWith gives a reason"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Parallel stage (ADR 0002)",
   "items": [
    "Plan is serial, Compute is pure and writes only out[task index], Apply is serial",
    "Merge in task-index order, never completion order; the lower ID wins",
    "Runs inline below minParallelTasks, and in captures and replays"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "Events (ADR 0003)",
   "items": [
    "A tick runs commands, timers, systems in order, then the end checks",
    "One drain after each emitting system keeps today's order",
    "The queue is empty at every tick's end, so it is in neither the hash nor the save"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "slate",
